# lift-patchbox view

I would you like to generate a plan for a new plugin (in the grammars
directory). You will look at the corresponding skill for writting plugins.

The plugins will recognize and parse LiftPatchShort syntax, i.e. a syntax for
expressing lexical information. a library containing a parser for this language
is in the ../lift-patchbox directory. Please report if you cannot access it.

